  "checked_invariants": [
    "DrawConstants is 288 bytes with material parameters at byte 272 and a 512-byte aligned draw stride.",
    "Material views 138 and 139 fit the 152-entry frame view range; six added RTVs occupy slots 36 through 41 in the 42-entry heap.",
    "Material targets are owned by retired frame contexts; resize flushes both queues before releasing and recreating them.",
    "Resolve preserves complete MaterialData source fields, validates target existence and ambiguity transactionally, and normalizes runtime subnormal parameters while preserving original double settings.",
    "FrameGraph records GBuffer writes, lighting and trace reads, exposure dependencies and final Common state for each new target.",
    "Reflection registers t11 through t14 match root tables 14 through 17. Environment resources permit pixel and nonpixel reads.",
    "The material environment wrapper averages all 32 base, 16 coat and 8 diffuse samples, including zero contributions.",
    "Extended reflection tracing replaces the full environment specular term. Its fallback environment is pre-exposed once, hit radiance already carries the same frame exposure, and receiver AO is applied once.",
    "Default and explicit-zero material settings select the legacy six-target opaque path and the legacy transparent permutation.",
    "Build and package metadata include all five material shader permutations and all shared material shader inputs."
  ],
